Common StudentEvaluationElement
documentation "The evaluation results for a student for the lowest level element or criterion."
domain entity ProgramEvaluationElement
    documentation "The program evaluation element associated with the student's results."
    is part of identity
    is required
shared decimal EvaluationElementRating
    documentation "The numerical rating or score for the evaluation element."
    is optional
descriptor EvaluationElementRating
    documentation "The rating level achieved based upon the rating or score for the evaluation element."
    is optional